{"id": "EUVD-2026-82991", "enisaUuid": "cd5bd0fe-0199-3348-bc46-b8e637644191", "description": "PLANET IGS-5225-8P2T4S industrial managed switch V1 and V2 firmware versions before 1.2412b260707 and 2.2412b260519 contain a stack-based buffer overflow in the web server. Insufficient bounds checking on data copied into a stack buffer allows a remote administrator to cause a denial of service or potentially execute arbitrary code on the underlying operating system.", "datePublished": "2026-09-18T15:19:13", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-26T13:29:55", "baseScore": 7.5, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:H/AT:N/PR:H/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://www.planet.com.tw/en/support/security-advisory/11", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/planet-igs-5225-8p2t4s-v1-v2-admin-stack-based-buffer-overflow-via-web-server"], "aliases": ["GHSA-g83m-6h5f-4hqj", "CVE-2026-81945"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.58, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "aa49ab65-e7da-3e09-9c0d-8791c82b8637", "product": {"name": "PLANET IGS-5225-8P2T4S V2", "vendor": {"name": "PLANET Technology Corp."}}, "product_version": "0 <2.2412b260519"}, {"id": "ca82e9e9-40e2-36b4-8fda-3a6de49f8c7c", "product": {"name": "PLANET IGS-5225-8P2T4S V1", "vendor": {"name": "PLANET Technology Corp."}}, "product_version": "0 <1.2412b260707"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "25e53892-d87d-3844-959e-af498f76b739", "vendor": {"name": "PLANET Technology Corp."}}], "isExploited": false}